<title>JAPAN: Japan 96/97 housing starts rise 9.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Japan 96/97 housing starts rise 9.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's housing starts rose 9.8 percent in fiscal 1996/97 from a year earlier to 1.63 million units, the Construction Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					  1996/97     yr/yr pct change</p>
<p> Private homes		     636,306	    +15.6</p>
<p> Rental homes			616,186	     +9.3</p>
<p> Employee housing		   25,847	     +0.2</p>
<p> Housing built for sale	  352,039	     +2.1</p>
<p>  Condominiums		     199,500	     +0.6</p>
<p> Total			     1,630,378	     +9.8</p>
</text>
